# Duskwood (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Duskwood: the four-quest Nothing But The Truth
# chain (Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin, east, band 37-42) plus
# the Level 60 Leatherworking writ as a special class. Every accept is on key
# 1431; the chain's objectives and its final turn-in lie outside Duskwood and
# ride honest expedition legs below. See docs/duskwood-horde-census.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/duskwood-horde
title Duskwood (Horde)
levels 37-42
zone Duskwood
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step The east - Deathstalker Zraedus

  note The Horde side of Duskwood is one chain and one writ: Deathstalker Zraedus (87.81,35.63) and Apothecary Faustin (87.45,35.25) hold the east at 37 to 42, and Kzixx's post holds the Level 60 Leatherworking writ as a special class. The chain's objectives and final turn-in lie outside Duskwood - the expedition legs below carry them.
  goto 87.81,35.63
  accept 1372 -- Nothing But The Truth - Deathstalker Zraedus; Apothecary Faustin waits nearby
  turnin 1372 -- Nothing But The Truth - to Apothecary Faustin
  accept 1383 -- Nothing But The Truth - Apothecary Faustin; hearts, fungus and tumor, all out of zone
  note 1383's objectives drop nowhere in Duskwood - the Swamp of Sorrows and Desolace legs below gather them; hand 1383 in on the return.

step Expedition - the Swamp of Sorrows legs

  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  complete 1383 @69.4,66.4 era -- Shadow Panther Hearts off the Shadow Panthers, east
  complete 1383 @88.2,40.8 era -- more Shadow Panther Hearts, south-east
  complete 1383 @5.5,31.38 era -- the Mire Lord Fungus off the Mire Lord, far west
  note Siopi is named on 1383's heart table but has no spawn in any zone in the data - hunt the Shadow Panthers, not the name.
  zone Duskwood

step Expedition - the Desolace leg

  zone Desolace
  complete 1383 @66.26,32.79 era -- the Deepstrider Tumor off the Deepstrider Giant, east
  complete 1383 @32.07,24.66 era -- the Deepstrider Tumor off the Deepstrider Searcher, west
  note Either Deepstrider fills the single tumor - take whichever side the road gives.
  zone Duskwood

step The east - Faustin to Zraedus

  goto 87.45,35.25
  turnin 1383 -- Nothing But The Truth - the hearts, fungus and tumor to Apothecary Faustin
  accept 1388 -- Nothing But The Truth - Apothecary Faustin; back to Zraedus
  turnin 1388 -- Nothing But The Truth - to Deathstalker Zraedus
  accept 1391 -- Nothing But The Truth - Deathstalker Zraedus; Infiltrator Marksen waits in the Swamp of Sorrows
  note 1391's turn-in is a Swamp of Sorrows expedition - the leg below carries it.

step Expedition - Marksen's turn-in

  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  turnin 1391 -- Nothing But The Truth - to Infiltrator Marksen @44.29,52.43 era
  zone Duskwood

step Kzixx's post - writ: tunic (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 81.82,19.77
  accept 94241 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Dark Leather Tunic - Kzixx; back to Kzixx, at 60
  note 94241's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94241 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Dark Leather Tunic - back to Kzixx
